- `git.fartlab.dev/homelab/charts/docs/` → `/charts/`
- `git.fartlab.dev/homelab/infra/docs/` → `/infra/`
- `git.fartlab.dev/homelab/homelab-tools/docs/` → `/homelab-tools/`

